{"repositoryId":871814376,"availability":"available","full":"orhanaydinn/orhanaydinn","name":"orhanaydinn","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":null,"stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-10-13T02:34:30Z","updated":"2026-10-13T00:00:44Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://ai-job-copilot.lemonmeadow-e3bba0f9.francecentral.azurecontainerapps.io/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:54.601Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:54.601Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:54.601Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-13T07:37:54.601Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["I’m an AI and Robotics Engineer with a background in Mechatronics Engineering and an MSc in Data Science and Artificial Intelligence from Bournemouth University, where I graduated with Distinction. I enjoy building things and understanding how their different parts work together, whether that means developing an AI application or connecting software, perception and control in a physical system.","My projects span full-stack AI applications, language models, computer vision and robotics. I’ve built tools for working with documents and automating workflows, trained a language model from scratch, and developed a humanoid robot as part of my MSc thesis. Across these projects, I particularly enjoy taking an idea through design, implementation and testing, then working through the details that make the complete system useful and reliable.","Before my MSc, I worked in industrial engineering, focusing on mechanical design, automation and production reliability. That experience taught me to consider practical constraints, investigate problems carefully and measure the impact of a change. I now bring that approach to both AI and robotics, and I’m looking to join a team where I can contribute to meaningful projects, learn from experienced engineers and continue growing across software and intelligent systems."],"features":["An MSc thesis system powered by OAX, a language model I pre-trained from scratch and fine-tuned for structured tool calling. Integrates visual perception, system state and Planner–Controller validation with a custom…","Python · PyTorch · OpenCV · Tool Calling · Embedded Control","Full-stack AI application for CV-to-job analysis, evidence-backed matches, tailored CVs and cover letters, editable previews and DOCX export. Deployed on Azure.","React · TypeScript · FastAPI · Azure OpenAI · Docker","Case Study · GitHub · Live Demo"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orhanaydinn/orhanaydinn/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"37251fb37c7f2bb727d86d8978bab2ad00bb63508383565fba184aa35d8e7b97","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:54.744Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:54.744Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"I’m an AI and Robotics Engineer with a background in Mechatronics Engineering and an MSc in Data Science and Artificial Intelligence from Bournemouth University, where I graduated with Distinction. I enjoy building things and understanding how their different parts work together, whether that means developing an AI application or connecting software, perception and control in a physical system.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orhanaydinn/orhanaydinn/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"37251fb37c7f2bb727d86d8978bab2ad00bb63508383565fba184aa35d8e7b97","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orhanaydinn/orhanaydinn/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:54.745Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-13T00:00:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orhanaydinn/orhanaydinn/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:54.745Z","hash":"37251fb37c7f2bb727d86d8978bab2ad00bb63508383565fba184aa35d8e7b97","originalBytes":8470,"storedBytes":8470,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["case","github","language","study","tool","control",